Hi all! 1st post here in a looong time.

I finally did it! I've been playing on and off since the '80s, but
just started seriously playing about 8 or 9 months ago. And finally,
my Valkyrie heard an invisible choir and was bathed in radiance. Prior
to this game, I had never even seen the Valley of the Dead.

Amazing! Thank you Tyr!

My good luck started when I found an unidentified lamp, had a good
feeling about it, and just randomly dipped it in holy water and rubbed
it. Presto! Gray scale for me! I had stupendous luck finding good
items, and after the castle and a Wand of Wishing I had pretty much
everything I needed. I found a second wand in Gehennom and literally
had wishes to burn.

I had a bit of trouble in Beelzebub's Lair when I got trapped with an
Archlich and an infinite supply of Barbed Demons. Luckily, they never
whipped my Mjollnir out of my hands, but they did manage to get me
down to 8hp. Yikes! After a short coniption fit, I remembered to
#Invoke my Orb of Fate and it ported me up to DLvl 14 (kind of far
away!).

A bit later, I did a bit of polypiling and managed to turn a stack of
about 6 blank scrolls into scrolls of Genocide. Another holy water and
all Eels, Rust Monsters, Mind Flayers, Cockatrices, and everything
else nasty was outta there.

Heading back to Gehennom, I pretty much walked through everything from
there, but when fighting the Wizard I killed him over the moat and
didn't know how to get the book out of the water. I learned that
jumping in it doesn't work. Ha! I zapped a Wand of Cold and recovered
the book of the dead (Thanks spoilers!)

Down to the Invocation, I took out Moloch and gazed upon the Amulet of
Yendor for the 1st time. Yay!

On the way up, I only saw the wizard twice, but he did manage to grab
the amulet from me once around DLvl 18. I had one of my 3 Wands of
Death out, and hit him quick to get it back.

After a quick stop near the top for some penning of Enchant Armor
scrolls (I still had a LOT of blank scrolls from the moat incident), I
proceeded to the Planes.

Since I had wishes to burn, I conjured up a Blessed Crystal Ball and
searched for ^ (portals) to speed my way through. I blew up 2 on the
Fire plane though, guess it's too hot for glass there or something.
*shrug*

And on to the Astral Plane! I go right, duck back left when I see
Famine, duck to the middle when I see Death, and go straight up the
center to Tyr's Altar. 1st try!

I have the screenshot in my work cubicle as a reminder of my
demigoddesshood. I ended with 5,289,584, level 25, 300 HP.

YAY!

